{!<span class="ideology-tooltip-wrap seat bsw" tabindex="0">BSW<span class="ideology-tooltip-tip"><strong class="ideology-tooltip-title">Bündnis Sahra Wagenknecht</strong><span class="ideology-tooltip-description">Led by Wagenknecht. Left-conservative.</span></span></span>!}: [+ bsw_leader +] ([+ bsw_ideology +])

