= Internal Factions of the SPD

{!<span class="ideology-tooltip-wrap left color" tabindex="0">Parlamentarische Linke<span class="ideology-tooltip-tip"><strong class="ideology-tooltip-title">Parlamentarische Linke</strong><span class="ideology-tooltip-description">The left wing of the SPD, close to the Jusos. Wants redistribution, a looser debt brake and cooperation with the Greens and Die Linke.</span></span></span>!} strength: [+ left_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ left_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="ideology-tooltip-wrap center color" tabindex="0">Netzwerk Berlin<span class="ideology-tooltip-tip"><strong class="ideology-tooltip-title">Netzwerk Berlin</strong><span class="ideology-tooltip-description">The pragmatic camp around the party leadership, between the left and right wings.</span></span></span>!} strength: [+ center_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ center_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="ideology-tooltip-wrap labor color" tabindex="0">AfA<span class="ideology-tooltip-tip"><strong class="ideology-tooltip-title">AfA</strong><span class="ideology-tooltip-description">The trade union wing. Wants secure jobs, higher wages and benefits for organized workers.</span></span></span>!} strength: [+ labor_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ labor_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="ideology-tooltip-wrap reformist color" tabindex="0">Seeheimer Kreis<span class="ideology-tooltip-tip"><strong class="ideology-tooltip-title">Seeheimer Kreis</strong><span class="ideology-tooltip-description">The conservative wing. Pragmatic participants in government who favour fiscal discipline and coalitions with the centre.</span></span></span>!} strength: [+ reformist_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ reformist_dissent : dissent +]

[? if neorevisionism > 0 : Neorevisionist strength: [+ neorevisionist_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ neorevisionist_dissent : dissent +] ?]

